  "author": "uniwire examples",
  
  "lang": "en",
  "notes": [
   "Demonstrates: IEC 60364-7-709 marina supply: every socket outlet individually protected by its own 30 mA RCBO disconnecting all poles, IEC 60309 sockets, pontoon feeder pillars on their own sheets (own_sheet), selective 300 mA type S RCDs on pontoon feeders, templates with phase allocation",
   "TN-S from the harbour master building; no PEN conductor beyond the main switchboard (TN-C forbidden in marinas)",
   "Pontoon A: 4 pedestals of 4 x 16 A (40 small berths, diversity 0.5 per 709.311); pontoon B: 2 superyacht pedestals 63 A 3P+N + 32 A"
  ]
 },
